{"seq":1,"slug":"perfect-set-property","title":"完美集性质：连续统假设的可定义版本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/regularity/perfect-set-property","wordCount":1488,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"完美集性质-连续统假设的可定义版本\">完美集性质：连续统假设的可定义版本</h1><p>康托尔在证明连续统假设时曾抱有一个朴素希望：任何不可数的实数集，只要「足够规整」，就一定含有连续统那么多点，不存在介于可数与连续统之间的中间基数。这个希望对一般集合会破产（Bernstein 集就卡在中间），但对可定义集合却成立。承载这个成立的性质就叫完美集性质（PSP）。它是三大正则性质里最几何、也最直接触及连续统假设的一条——一个集合有 PSP，等于说「连续统假设在这个集合上自动成立」。这一篇讲清 PSP 的定义、Cantor–Bendixson 的经典证明、它随复杂度爬升如何在余解析层第一次失效，以及大基数如何把它重新救回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-完美集与二歧结论\">核心概念：完美集与二歧结论</h2><p>一个集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 称为<strong>完美集</strong>，如果它非空、闭、且没有孤立点（每个点都是自身的极限点）。完美集的原型是康托尔集：闭、无孤立点、不可数。关键引理是——<strong>每个非空完美集都含有一个同胚于康托尔空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{\\mathbb{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8452em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8452em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbb mtight\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的子集</strong>，因而基数恰好是连续统 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℵ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{\\aleph_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>一个集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 具有<strong>完美集性质（PSP）</strong>，如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 要么可数，要么包含一个非空完美子集。合起来这给出一个二歧结论：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mtext> 有 PSP</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℵ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext> 或 </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℵ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\text{ 有 PSP} \\implies |A| \\le \\aleph_0 \\ \\text{或}\\ |A| = 2^{\\aleph_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有</span><span class=\"mord\"> PSP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>中间没有第三种可能。换言之，凡是有 PSP 的集合都不可能是连续统假设的反例。这就是为什么 PSP 被称作「连续统假设的可定义版本」——它把一个独立于 ZFC 的全局命题，降解成对特定复杂度集合可证的局部定理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;集合 A ⊆ 波兰空间&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;A 有 PSP?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C{&quot;A 可数?&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[&quot;|A| ≤ ℵ₀&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[&quot;A ⊇ 完美集&lt;br/&gt;|A| = 2^ℵ₀&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| F[&quot;Bernstein / 瘦集合&lt;br/&gt;可能卡在中间基数&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;CH 在 A 上平凡成立&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"集合 A ⊆ 波兰空间\"] --&gt; B{\"A 有 PSP?\"}\n  B --&gt;|是| C{\"A 可数?\"}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[\"|A| ≤ ℵ₀\"]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[\"A ⊇ 完美集&lt;br/&gt;|A| = 2^ℵ₀\"]\n  B --&gt;|否| F[\"Bernstein / 瘦集合&lt;br/&gt;可能卡在中间基数\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"CH 在 A 上平凡成立\"]\n  E --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"cantor-bendixson-闭集的-psp\">Cantor–Bendixson：闭集的 PSP</h2><p>最古老的成立结果针对闭集。<strong>Cantor–Bendixson 定理</strong>说：波兰空间里每个闭集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 都能唯一分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = P \\sqcup C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是完美集（可能为空）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 可数。构造靠迭代「导出算子」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>↦</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F\\mapsto F&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6943em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（去掉所有孤立点）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⊇</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>⊇</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⊇</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F\\supseteq F&#x27;\\supseteq F&#x27;&#x27;\\supseteq\\cdots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8879em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8879em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.313em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span></span></span></span></span> 沿序数递减，因空间可分（第二可数）这条递减链必在某个可数序数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>（Cantor–Bendixson 秩）稳定，稳定值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=F^{(\\alpha)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是完美核，被移除的孤立点全体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是可数的。于是闭集要么可数、要么含完美子集——闭集有 PSP。这也顺带证明了「闭集版连续统假设」：不可数闭集必有连续统那么多点。这里的完备性与可分性正是 <a href=\"../foundations/polish-spaces\">波兰空间</a> 一章反复强调的良性回报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"爬升到解析层-仍然成立\">爬升到解析层：仍然成立</h2><p>PSP 能爬多高？答案是解析层仍然成立。<strong>每个解析集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都有 PSP</strong>，证明用 <a href=\"../hierarchies/analytic-sets\">解析集</a> 里的树表示：不可数解析集的投影树 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 拥有一棵「完美子树」（在两个不相容节点处持续分叉的满二叉子树），其分支集就是一个嵌入的康托尔集，即完美子集。于是解析集也逃不出「可数或连续统」的二歧。</p>\n<p>这条结果意义重大——它说明连续统假设对所有解析集（远比 Borel 宽）自动为真，是 ZFC 内不用任何额外公理就能拿到的最好结果。三大正则性质在解析层齐步成立，构成一道自然的「ZFC 舒适区」边界。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复杂度层</th>\n<th>是否有 PSP</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>闭集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Π</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Pi}^0_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Π</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>Cantor–Bendixson（ZFC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Borel <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Δ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Δ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>包含于解析层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>树的完美子树（ZFC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余解析 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Π</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Pi}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Π</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>独立于 ZFC</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 中有反例；需不可达基数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 及以上</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n<td>需 Woodin 基数 / PD</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"余解析层的失效与大基数救援\">余解析层的失效与大基数救援</h2><p>跨过解析层，PSP 第一次失效。哥德尔在可构造宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 里造出一个<strong>不可数却不含任何完美子集的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Π</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Pi}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Π</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 集</strong>（「瘦集合」，thin set）。它的构造依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 良序：沿这个良序逐点挑选、避开所有已出现的完美集，攒出一个不可数的稀疏集。这个集合正是介于可数与连续统之间的可定义反例，说明「余解析集有 PSP」不是 ZFC 定理。</p>\n<p>救援来自大基数。<strong>若存在一个不可达基数，则每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Π</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Pi}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Π</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（乃至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）集都有 PSP</strong>；更一般地，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个 Woodin 基数保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_{n+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1954em;vertical-align:-0.3053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 层有 PSP，无穷多 Woodin 基数下全体投影集都有 PSP。这个「复杂度—大基数」精确对应，与 <a href=\"../hierarchies/projective-hierarchy\">投影层级</a> 那张枢纽表完全吻合。而在决定性假设下，PSP 有一个统一来源：<strong>集合被决定 ⟹ 有 PSP</strong>，其博弈是「完美集博弈」，玩家 II 试图在集合内构造一棵完美子树，必胜策略直接产出完美子集——这条通道在 <a href=\"../practice/determinacy\">决定性</a> 里详述，也是三大正则性质被同一来源一次性兑现的第一例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>完美集 = 非空、闭、无孤立点；每个非空完美集含康托尔集，基数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℵ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2^{\\aleph_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>PSP：集合要么可数、要么含完美子集，因而「可数或连续统」二歧成立——PSP 是连续统假设的可定义局部版本。</li>\n<li>Cantor–Bendixson 证闭集有 PSP，树论证把它推到解析层；解析层是 ZFC 内 PSP 成立的复杂度上限。</li>\n<li>余解析层在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 中出现瘦集合反例；不可达基数、Woodin 基数或决定性逐级把 PSP 救回，与投影层级的枢纽表一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章邻篇：<a href=\"baire-property\">Baire 性质</a> 与 <a href=\"measurability\">勒贝格可测性</a> —— 另两条随复杂度衰减的正则性质。</li>\n<li>PSP 在解析层成立的树论证来源：<a href=\"../hierarchies/analytic-sets\">解析集</a>。</li>\n<li>三大性质被决定性统一兑现：<a href=\"../practice/determinacy\">决定性</a>。</li>\n<li>完美集、孤立点、导出集的拓扑基础：<a href=\"../../topology-intro/connectedness-compactness/compactness-finite-covers\">拓扑学入门 · 紧致性与有限覆盖</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"完美集性质：连续统假设的可定义版本","id":"完美集性质-连续统假设的可定义版本"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：完美集与二歧结论","id":"核心概念-完美集与二歧结论"},{"level":2,"text":"Cantor–Bendixson：闭集的 PSP","id":"cantor-bendixson-闭集的-psp"},{"level":2,"text":"爬升到解析层：仍然成立","id":"爬升到解析层-仍然成立"},{"level":2,"text":"余解析层的失效与大基数救援","id":"余解析层的失效与大基数救援"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"投影层级：ZFC 失去裁决权的地带","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/hierarchies/projective-hierarchy"},"next":{"title":"Baire 性质：拓扑意义上的「几乎相等」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/regularity/baire-property"}}